        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Goofy 3D Collectathon Adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet <strong>Elgvis</strong>, a <i>rockabilly moose from Norway</i> with a slick quiff, a big heart, and an even bigger urge to explore! Join him on a colorful and silly 3D platforming journey filled with wacky worlds, strange characters, and classic collectathon charm inspired by the N64 era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search every corner to gather all <strong>100 Golden Antlers</strong>, unlock new areas, and uncover hidden secrets across forests, snowy peaks, spooky places, weird dimensions, and more. Every world brings its own personality, humor, and bizarre surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elgvis</strong> is a <i>simple, cozy, and fun 3D platformer</i> made for players who miss the charm and style of games like Banjo-Kazooie, Spyro the Dragon, and Super Mario 64.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elgvis and his girlfriend are planning a sweet motorcycle road trip — all the way to the Swedish border to buy cheap candy. <br>But first, Elgvis needs to meet her at her house so they can start the journey together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s just one problem:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The evil king, Sir Growls Alot</strong>, has blocked every world with giant <i>paywalls</i>, trapping the path between Elgvis and the love of his life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now Elgvis must travel through a series of wacky worlds, collect <strong>Golden Antlers</strong>, and tear down the paywalls one by one — all to reunite with his girlfriend and finally get that cheap Swedish candy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🦌 Play as Elgvis – a rockabilly moose with big dreams</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 Explore many wacky and colorful worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ Collect <strong>100 Golden Antlers</strong> to break the king’s paywalls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Simple, nostalgic, and cozy gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎵 A playful, cartoony atmosphere with lots of personality</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Goofy 3D Collectathon Adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet <strong>Elgvis</strong>, a <i>rockabilly moose from Norway</i> with a slick quiff, a big heart, and an even bigger urge to explore! Join him on a colorful and silly 3D platforming journey filled with wacky worlds, strange characters, and classic collectathon charm inspired by the N64 era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search every corner to gather all <strong>100 Golden Antlers</strong>, unlock new areas, and uncover hidden secrets across forests, snowy peaks, spooky places, weird dimensions, and more. Every world brings its own personality, humor, and bizarre surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elgvis</strong> is a <i>simple, cozy, and fun 3D platformer</i> made for players who miss the charm and style of games like Banjo-Kazooie, Spyro the Dragon, and Super Mario 64.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elgvis and his girlfriend are planning a sweet motorcycle road trip — all the way to the Swedish border to buy cheap candy. <br>But first, Elgvis needs to meet her at her house so they can start the journey together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s just one problem:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The evil king, Sir Growls Alot</strong>, has blocked every world with giant <i>paywalls</i>, trapping the path between Elgvis and the love of his life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now Elgvis must travel through a series of wacky worlds, collect <strong>Golden Antlers</strong>, and tear down the paywalls one by one — all to reunite with his girlfriend and finally get that cheap Swedish candy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🦌 Play as Elgvis – a rockabilly moose with big dreams</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 Explore many wacky and colorful worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ Collect <strong>100 Golden Antlers</strong> to break the king’s paywalls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Simple, nostalgic, and cozy gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎵 A playful, cartoony atmosphere with lots of personality</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Play as Elgvis, a rockabilly moose from Norway, on a goofy 3D collectathon adventure! Explore wacky worlds, meet weird characters, and gather 100 Golden Antlers to break the evil king Sir Growls Alot’s paywalls.",
